  75+ 918F ED 7B 96 99      LD SP, (MaiFlowSavedSP)         ; restaurar stack original
  76+ 9193 E2 97 91         JP PO, .mcffNoEI
  77+ 9196 FB               EI
  78+ 9197              .mcffNoEI:
  79+ 9197 C9               RET
