 724+ A2B0 EE 02            XOR 2                               ; toggle bit 1: 0↔2 (R↔L)
 725+ A2B2 DD 86 08         ADD A, (IX+ENT_ANIMBASE)
 726+ A2B5 DD 77 00         LD (IX+ENT_SPRITEID), A
 727+ A2B8              .peScaredNoFlip:
