1950+ A9F5 FE 0C            CP STAMINA_THRESHOLD_HIGH
1951+ A9F7 38 04            JR C, .smNotHigh
1952+ A9F9 3E 02            LD A, 2                             ; Libre (continuo)
1953+ A9FB 18 09            JR .smSet
1954+ A9FD              .smNotHigh:
1955+ A9FD FE 07            CP STAMINA_THRESHOLD_MID
1956+ A9FF 38 04            JR C, .smNotMid
1957+ AA01 3E 01            LD A, 1                             ; Fixed swing
1958+ AA03 18 01            JR .smSet
