1983+ AA1C              ; ==============================================================================
1984+ AA1C              ; CheckWellPickup - Recupera salud y stamina si el player pisa un pozo
1985+ AA1C              ; ==============================================================================
1986+ AA1C              CheckWellPickup:
1987+ AA1C 3A D0 8F         LD A, (WellActive)
1988+ AA1F B7               OR A
1989+ AA20 C8               RET Z                               ; No hay pozo en esta pantalla
1990+ AA21                  ; Cooldown activo? No curar (pozo "agotado" visual en blanco)
1991+ AA21 2A D4 8F         LD HL, (WellCooldownTimer)
1992+ AA24 7C               LD A, H
1993+ AA25 B5               OR L
1994+ AA26 C0               RET NZ                              ; timer > 0 → skip
1995+ AA27                  ; Ya esta al maximo? No hacer nada
1996+ AA27 3A 5D B2         LD A, (PlayerHealth)
1997+ AA2A FE 10            CP HEALTH_MAX
1998+ AA2C 20 06            JR NZ, .cwDoCheck
1999+ AA2E 3A 5E B2         LD A, (PlayerStamina)
2000+ AA31 FE 10            CP STAMINA_MAX
2001+ AA33 C8               RET Z                               ; Ambos al maximo → nada
2002+ AA34              .cwDoCheck:
2003+ AA34                  ; AABB con margen de 8px (1 celda) por cada lado:
2004+ AA34                  ; playerX < wellX+24 AND wellX-8 < playerX+16
2005+ AA34                  ; playerY < wellY+24 AND wellY-8 < playerY+21
2006+ AA34                  ; --- Check X ---
2007+ AA34 3A D1 8F         LD A, (WellPosX)
2008+ AA37 C6 18            ADD A, 24                           ; C = wellX + 16 + 8 (wellRight + margen)
2009+ AA39 4F               LD C, A
2010+ AA3A 3A B3 80         LD A, (EntityTable + ENT_POSX)      ; A = playerX
2011+ AA3D B9               CP C                                ; playerX < wellRight+margen?
2012+ AA3E 30 3C            JR NC, .cwNoOverlap                 ; no → fuera
2013+ AA40 3A B3 80         LD A, (EntityTable + ENT_POSX)
2014+ AA43 C6 18            ADD A, 24                           ; C = playerX + 16 + 8 (playerRight + margen)
2015+ AA45 4F               LD C, A
2016+ AA46 3A D1 8F         LD A, (WellPosX)                    ; A = wellX
2017+ AA49 B9               CP C                                ; wellX < playerRight+margen?
2018+ AA4A 30 30            JR NC, .cwNoOverlap                 ; no → fuera
2019+ AA4C                  ; --- Check Y ---
2020+ AA4C 3A D2 8F         LD A, (WellPosY)
2021+ AA4F C6 18            ADD A, 24                           ; C = wellY + 16 + 8
2022+ AA51 4F               LD C, A
2023+ AA52 3A B4 80         LD A, (EntityTable + ENT_POSY)      ; A = playerY
2024+ AA55 B9               CP C                                ; playerY < wellBottom+margen?
2025+ AA56 30 24            JR NC, .cwNoOverlap                 ; no → fuera
2026+ AA58 3A B4 80         LD A, (EntityTable + ENT_POSY)
2027+ AA5B C6 1D            ADD A, 29                           ; C = playerY + 21 + 8
2028+ AA5D 4F               LD C, A
2029+ AA5E 3A D2 8F         LD A, (WellPosY)                    ; A = wellY
2030+ AA61 B9               CP C                                ; wellY < playerBottom+margen?
2031+ AA62 30 18            JR NC, .cwNoOverlap                 ; no → fuera
2032+ AA64                  ; --- Overlap! Recuperar salud y stamina ---
2033+ AA64 3E 10            LD A, HEALTH_MAX
2034+ AA66 32 5D B2         LD (PlayerHealth), A
2035+ AA69 3E 10            LD A, STAMINA_MAX
2036+ AA6B 32 5E B2         LD (PlayerStamina), A
2037+ AA6E                  ; Flash HUD y SFX
2038+ AA6E 3E 0A            LD A, 10                            ; 10 frames a 25fps = 0.4s (era 20 a 50fps)
2039+ AA70 32 D3 8F         LD (WellFlashTimer), A
2040+ AA73                  ; Arrancar cooldown: capturar attrs originales + pintar blanco
2041+ AA73 CD 7D AA         CALL StartWellCooldown
2042+ AA76 21 B0 DD         LD HL, SFX_WellRecover
2043+ AA79 CD F9 DC         CALL PlaySFX
2044+ AA7C              .cwNoOverlap:
2045+ AA7C C9               RET
2046+ AA7D
2047+ AA7D              ; ==============================================================================
2048+ AA7D              ; StartWellCooldown - al usar el pozo: captura originals, pinta blanco, arranca timer
2049+ AA7D              ; ==============================================================================
2050+ AA7D              ; Lee los 2 attrs actuales de CleanAttrMap (cian "limpio", ignora overlays
2051+ AA7D              ; de player/enemigos), los guarda en WellOrigAttrN para restaurar al final
2052+ AA7D              ; del cooldown. Luego pinta blanco en VRAM y CleanAttrMap.
2053+ AA7D              ; ==============================================================================
2054+ AA7D              StartWellCooldown:
2055+ AA7D CD AA AA         CALL GetWellBottomOffset            ; HL = offset fila inferior en attr map
2056+ AA80 E5               PUSH HL
2057+ AA81 11 CE 8C         LD DE, CleanAttrMap
2058+ AA84 19               ADD HL, DE
2059+ AA85 7E               LD A, (HL)
2060+ AA86 32 D6 8F         LD (WellOrigAttr0), A
2061+ AA89 23               INC HL
2062+ AA8A 7E               LD A, (HL)
2063+ AA8B 32 D7 8F         LD (WellOrigAttr1), A
2064+ AA8E E1               POP HL
2065+ AA8F CD C4 AA         CALL PaintWellWhiteAt               ; pinta blanco VRAM + CleanAttrMap
2066+ AA92 21 7D 00         LD HL, WELL_COOLDOWN_FRAMES
2067+ AA95 22 D4 8F         LD (WellCooldownTimer), HL
2068+ AA98 C9               RET
