4675+ B902              ; ==============================================================================
4676+ B902              ; MONSTER SPAWN/REPOSITION SYSTEM (simplified, robust)
4677+ B902              ; ==============================================================================
4678+ B902              ; ALL monsters ALWAYS appear at LastEntryPosX/Y (player's entry position).
4679+ B902              ; This is the ONLY guaranteed safe position (player fits there, 16x21).
4680+ B902              ; No nudge, no border scan, no MonsterSave, no buffer restore.
4681+ B902              ; ==============================================================================
4682+ B902              ; MONSTER SPAWN/REPOSITION SYSTEM (robust, simplified)
4683+ B902              ; ==============================================================================
4684+ B902              ; ALL monsters ALWAYS appear at LastEntryPosX/Y (player entry position).
4685+ B902              ; This is the ONLY guaranteed safe position (player fits 16x21 there).
4686+ B902              ; No nudge, no border scan, no MonsterSave, no buffer restore.
4687+ B902              ; ==============================================================================
4688+ B902              MONSTERS_TO_SPAWN   EQU 3
4689+ B902              MONSTER_ENTRY_BASE  EQU 50          ; Frames antes del primer monster (~1s)
4690+ B902              MONSTER_ENTRY_GAP   EQU 40          ; Frames entre cada monster (~0.8s)
