4695+ B902              SpawnMonsters:
4696+ B902 3A 63 B2         LD A, (MonstersActive)
4697+ B905 B7               OR A
4698+ B906 C0               RET NZ
4699+ B907 3E 01            LD A, 1
4700+ B909 32 63 B2         LD (MonstersActive), A
