5538+ BE63 C6 04            ADD A, 4                    ; enemyX + enemyW + margen
5539+ BE65 38 07            JR C, .bxCheck2
5540+ BE67 57               LD D, A
5541+ BE68 3A B3 80         LD A, (EntityTable + ENT_POSX)
