5623+ BEE1 57               LD D, A
5624+ BEE2 3A 2F C0         LD A, (.enH)
5625+ BEE5 82               ADD A, D
5626+ BEE6 C6 04            ADD A, 4
5627+ BEE8 38 08            JR C, .syCheck2
5628+ BEEA 57               LD D, A
5629+ BEEB 3A B4 80         LD A, (EntityTable + ENT_POSY)
