5647+ BF06
5648+ BF06                  ; Player atacando → destruir enemigo o knockback monster
5649+ BF06 DD CB 0B 56      BIT ENTF_DESTRUCT, (IX+ENT_FLAGS)
5650+ BF0A C2 9D BF         JP NZ, .killNasty              ; Destructible → matar
5651+ BF0D                  ; No destructible (monster) → knockback
5652+ BF0D DD 7E 01         LD A, (IX+ENT_TYPE)
5653+ BF10 FE 02            CP TYPE_MONSTER
5654+ BF12 C2 C7 BF         JP NZ, .playerHit              ; No es monster → hit normal
