5682+ BF3A AF               XOR A
5683+ BF3B CB 52            BIT 2, D                        ; DIR_E
5684+ BF3D 28 02            JR Z, .kbNoRight
5685+ BF3F 3E 04            LD A, MONSTER_KB_SPEED
5686+ BF41              .kbNoRight:
