 572+ C3AB 32 A9 C4         LD (.heightCnt), A
 573+ C3AE DD 7E 01         LD A, (IX+1)                ; width_bytes (bit 7 = RLE flag)
 574+ C3B1 32 AD C4         LD (.rleFlag), A
